# CITATION.cff - Citation metadata for equilibria
# GitHub automatically detects this file and displays a "Cite this repository" button
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "equilibria: A Modern Python Framework for CGE Modeling"
abstract: >-
  A Python framework for Computable General Equilibrium (CGE) modeling that
  builds models from modular equation blocks and checks them cell by cell
  against GAMS and GEMPACK, with native HAR I/O and templates for GTAP
  Standard 7 and PEP-1-1.
